  _poisonTutorialLines:
  - Hey, kid. You out here all alone, or am I just seeing things?
  - "Then again\u2026 who\u2019d you even expect to keep you company? That scrawny
    rat over there?"
  - "Heh\u2026 though, who knows, maybe it\u2019s brewing potions too."
  - "So, word is - you\u2019re not much of a cook, but you sure know how to poison."
  - "That\u2019s good. I like people who know how to impress guests right away."
  - "But tell me honestly - are you sure you know what you\u2019re doing?"
  - Or are you just tossing stuff in until something explodes?
  - "Alright, alright, don\u2019t get mad. It\u2019s simple. You\u2019ve got recipes.
    Two, to be exact. One\u2019s weak."
  - "The other\u2026 well, let\u2019s just say it doesn\u2019t leave many witnesses."
  - It all starts with a <color=yellow>golden</color> flower.
  - The order matters. <color=red>Red</color>, <color=purple>purple</color>, <color=green>green</color>,
    <color=green>green</color> - it all has meaning.
  - "But here\u2019s the fun part\u2026 if you mess up\u2026 heh-heh\u2026"
  - "You\u2019ll be the first to taste your own brew."
  - "And trust me, that\u2019s not a compliment to the chef."
  - "Now, be a good little witch and whip me up something\u2026 classic. Just a regular
    poison."
  - "No surprises, alright? I\u2019ve got plans tonight."
