  _poisonTutorialFinishLines:
  - "Heh-heh\u2026 well, would you look at that. You actually pulled it off."
  - "And here I was, thinking I\u2019d have to gather the ingredients myself."
  - "And y\u2019know\u2026 I wasn\u2019t really in the mood."
  - "Gotta say, it smells\u2026 hmm\u2026 promising. Not too sharp, not too weak.
    Just right."
  - "I see you know how to listen. That\u2019s a rare skill, y\u2019know."
  - "So tell me\u2026 how does it feel? Making poison? Knowing that every drop is
    someone\u2019s last breath?"
  - "That with just a flick of your finger\u2026 you could decide someone else\u2019s
    fate?"
  - "\u2026Eh, don\u2019t think too hard about it. I\u2019m just messing with ya.
    Really."
  - "Either way, you did good. This was\u2026 interesting. Maybe I\u2019ll drop by
    again sometime."
  - "Or maybe\u2026 you\u2019ll wish I hadn\u2019t."
  _localizedPoisonTutorialFinishKeys:
