  _extraPoisonTutorialLines:
  - HEY, YOU!
  - THINK YOU CAN JUST WALTZ IN HERE AND BREW THE STRONGEST POISON?! HA!
  - "THIS ISN\u2019T JUST A BREW - THIS IS A TRIAL!"
  - ONLY THOSE WHO CAN STAND THE HEAT DESERVE TO COMMAND THIS POWER!
  - "LISTEN CLOSELY! YOU CAN\u2019T JUST THROW INGREDIENTS AROUND LIKE SOME FOOLISH
    GOBLIN!"
  - NO! YOU HAVE TO BE PRECISE! STRATEGIC!
  - VICTORY ONLY BELONGS TO THOSE WHO FOLLOW THE RIGHT PLAN!
  - <color=purple>PURPLE</color>, <color=red>RED</color>, <color=red>RED</color>,
    <color=purple>PURPLE</color>, <color=green>GREEN</color>!
  - "IF YOU DO EVERYTHING RIGHT - YOU\u2019LL CREATE THE STRONGEST POISON, CAPABLE
    OF BRINGING DOWN ANYONE!"
  - "BUT IF YOU MESS UP\u2026 YOU\u2019LL BE ITS FIRST VICTIM!"
  - "NOW GO! SHOW ME YOU\u2019RE NOT SOME WEAKLING! BREW THAT POISON!"
  _localizedExtraPoisonTutorialKeys:
