  _extraPoisonTutorialFinishLines:
  - "HAHAHAHA! NOW THAT\u2019S WHAT I\u2019M TALKING ABOUT!"
  - YOU DID IT! A TRUE, POWERFUL, UNSTOPPABLE POISON!
  - "THIS IS LIKE A TRUE BATTLE ELIXIR! IF THIS FALLS INTO THE WRONG HANDS\u2026"
  - "HA, WHO AM I KIDDING?! THEY WON\u2019T SURVIVE!"
  - "YOU\u2019RE DOING GREAT. BUT REMEMBER - THIS ISN\u2019T A GAME!"
  - "THE POWER YOU CREATE - IT\u2019S A RESPONSIBILITY! DON\u2019T LET IT GO TO WASTE!"
  - GOOD JOB. IF I EVER NEED MORE POISON - NOW I KNOW WHO TO CALL!
