  _failFinishLines:
  - "Wow, you actually did it! Alright, let\u2019s see\u2026"
  - "\u2026Are you serious? This was supposed to work?"
  - "Oh, of course! Maybe if we water it down a little more, it\u2019ll be completely
    useless!"
  - "Eh, whatever\u2026 Mistakes should be corrected <color=black>immediately</color>."
