    m_LocalVariables: []
  _poisonDialogues:
  - Lines:
    - "A poison, huh? Hm. I\u2019ve had worse contracts. But if it's needed, someone
      must\u2019ve earned it. Brew it."
  - Lines:
    - "I need something\u2026 discreet. Something that does its job before anyone
      even realizes. Can you handle that?"
  - Lines:
    - "Oh, poison! What a\u2026 sophisticated tool. Why get our hands dirty when
      we can resolve things elegantly, right?"
  - Lines:
    - "Death by poison is checkmate without noise or blood. The enemy won\u2019t
      realize their loss until it\u2019s too late. Ready?"
  - Lines:
    - "In this world, only the fastest survive. Give me poison, and I\u2019ll make
      sure no one even has time to blink."
  - Lines:
    - Some things are better done quietly. Can you handle it?
  - Lines:
    - "You know, sometimes it\u2019s easier to get rid of someone without all the
      noise. You know how to make that happen?"
  - Lines:
    - I prefer silent methods. Will your poison do?
  - Lines:
    - "Hey, I need somethin\u2019\u2026 y\u2019know, that does the job without all
      the noise. Got it?"
  - Lines:
    - The weak do not deserve power. Give me poison, and I will cleanse the world
      of them.
