  _poisonFinishDialogues:
  - Lines:
    - Strong. Pure. No unnecessary additives. If they die quickly, you did well.
      Stay safe.
  - Lines:
    - "Excellent work, a Phantom Thief would approve. Now\u2026 I vanish as silently
      as I came."
  - Lines:
    - "You exceeded my expectations! This\u2026 is perfect. Maybe next time, you\u2019ll
      make something even more exquisite?"
  - Lines:
    - "Magnificent. You created a tool that ends everything in one move. Now\u2026
      the game is over."
  - Lines:
    - "Precise. Clean. Just as it should be. You\u2019ve impressed me, gunslinger."
  - Lines:
    - You just made the right decision for the whole galaxy. Good work, soldier.
  - Lines:
    - Simple. Effective. No witnesses. Just the way I like it. You did good.
  - Lines:
    - Target eliminated. Excellent work.
  - Lines:
    - Man, this is sick! You really know your stuff!
  - Lines:
    - A painless death. Elegant. You exceeded my expectations.
