  _extraPoisonDialogues:
  - Lines:
    - "\u2026Do you feel it? The stench of weakness clings to this world. It has
      been consumed by cowardice and false hope. Fix it. Give me a poison that will
      reduce them to dust."
  - Lines:
    - "Humanity\u2026 so pitiful in its weakness. I need a poison that will wake
      them from their illusions. One that will show only the strong deserve to live.
      Can you handle it?"
  - Lines:
    - "Sins must be punished\u2026 pain is not enough. Bring me a poison to cleanse
      their souls\u2026 permanently."
  - Lines:
    - Power is everything. Give me a poison that will show fate belongs only to those
      strong enough to take it.
  - Lines:
    - "Do you feel the chill? It is the call\u2026 the call of eternity. Give me
      a poison that will show them death is only the beginning."
  - Lines:
    - This world is rotting. People cling to their meaningless lives. I need a poison
      to free them from this illusion.
  - Lines:
    - "Tell me\u2026 do you know what insanity is? It's doing the same thing over
      and over and expecting different results. I need a poison that will change
      their reality\u2026 permanently."
  - Lines:
    - At night, the world belongs to me. But there are those who dare to resist.
      Bring me a poison that will make them bow their heads.
  - Lines:
    - "The weak deserve only one thing\u2014destruction. Give me a poison to prove
      that only the strong survive."
  - Lines:
    - Progress demands sacrifice. Give me a poison that will clear the path to perfection.
