  _extraPoisonFinishDialogues:
  - Lines:
    - "Hmm\u2026 This poison\u2026 It carries pure destruction. Good work. The world
      will burn clean."
  - Lines:
    - "Perfect. This\u2026 is a new dawn. Evolution is coming, and it will not spare
      the weak."
  - Lines:
    - "Now\u2026 they understand. Be cleansed\u2026 or perish."
  - Lines:
    - "Hmph\u2026 As it should be. Weakness must be purged."
  - Lines:
    - "Excellent\u2026 They will join my ranks. The time has come."
  - Lines:
    - "Hah\u2026 the cleansing hour has come. All life will bow to my will."
  - Lines:
    - "HAHA! Now that\u2019s what I\u2019m talking about! They\u2019ll finally know
      what true chaos is!"
  - Lines:
    - "Hah\u2026 Now the night is mine once more. Excellent work."
  - Lines:
    - HAHA! I approve. You have proven your worth.
  - Lines:
    - "Excellent\u2026 This poison is a step toward a greater future."
